{"id":661,"vendor_key":"tencent","vendor_name_zh":"腾讯","title":"[HF] tencent/WeMM-Video-2B","url":"https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-2B","source_type":"hf_api","published_at":"2026-11-20T06:39:53+00:00","detected_at":"2026-11-20T06:43:46Z","is_major":false,"trigger_status":"confirmed","official_benchmarks":[],"self_evals":[],"related_papers":[],"summary":{"summary_zh":"腾讯发布 WeMM-Video-2B，这是 WeMM-Video 系列中的 2B 稠密（dense）检查点，是一个面向中英双语联合音视频理解与推理的全模态模型。该模型接受文本、图像、音频和视频输入并生成中英文文本回复，可将视频帧与原始音轨结合进行事件描述、语音转写和视听联合推理。架构上采用独立的视觉与音频编码器将媒体转为 token 供语言模型处理，视频帧携带时间戳；模型在约 1.2 万亿多模态 token 上预训练，后训练阶段采用多教师 OPD、防重复 MrDPO 和专家强化学习。同时提供了 FP8、AWQ、GGUF、NVFP4 等多种量化版本，并支持 vLLM、SGLang 和 Transformers 部署。","innovations":[{"dimension":"architecture","title":"视听双编码器全模态架构","detail":"独立的视觉与音频编码器将媒体转为 token 交由语言模型处理，视频帧携带时间戳，支持视频+音轨联合输入"},{"dimension":"posttrain","title":"多教师蒸馏与防重复 DPO 后训练","detail":"后训练采用多教师 OPD、防重复 MrDPO 以及专家强化学习"}],"progress_magnitude":"moderate","progress_note":"属于 WeMM-Video 系列新发布的 2B 稠密检查点，页面未提供具体基准分数，进步幅度不确定","predecessor":null,"source_urls":["https://arxiv.org/abs/2611.26409","https://github.com/Tencent/WeMM-Video","https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-2B","https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-2B-FP8","https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-2B-AWQ","https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-2B-GGUF","https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-2B-NVFP4","https://huggingface.co/tencent/WeMM-Video-35BA3B"],"confidence":"medium","generated_by":"glm_anthro:glm-5.3","generated_at":"2026-11-20T08:35:08Z"},"model_specs":{"params_billions":2.0,"active_params_billions":null,"architecture":"dense","num_experts":null,"context_window":null,"max_output":null,"modalities":["text","image","audio","video"],"weights":"open","license":"apache-2.0"},"training":{"pretrain_tokens_trillions":1.2,"data_mix":"多模态token（multimodal tokens）","compute":null,"pretrain_innovations":["多模态token预训练（约1.2万亿）","视频帧带时间戳","视觉与音频编码器生成media token"],"posttrain_innovations":["multi-teacher OPD","anti